# Line endings: LF in the repository and in the working tree, on every platform.
# A tool that writes "\r\n" into a text-mode file on Windows produces "\r\r\n"
# here (paid in session 55: devlog/2026-10-18.md, guardrails/08); keeping the
# working tree at LF means such a slip shows up in `git status` instead of
# silently rewriting a whole file in the next commit.
* text=auto eol=lf
